<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Feb domestic output down 0.9%.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Feb domestic output down 0.9%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Motors Corp said on Friday its domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas production in February were, with percentage changes from a year earlier, as follows:</p>
<p> Production	  116,519   down  0.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		78,017   down  2.2 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     38,502   up    1.6 percent</p>
<p> Domestic sales     71,602   up    3.0 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		38,411   up   12.6 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     33,191   down  6.2 percent</p>
<p> Exports		46,770   up    5.9 percent</p>
<p>  - Cars		33,151   up   14.1 percent</p>
<p>  - Truck &amp; Bus     13,619   down  9.9 percent</p>
<p> Overseas output    59,583   up   30.8 percent</p>
</text>
